id: DRAFT-darts-0.32-hmdfs-getcwd-tmpdir-pwd-fallback
trigger_tool: autoconf|configure|make|conan|sh
phase: configure|compile
error_signature: getcwd: cannot access parent directories|error retrieving current directory|Read-only file system|/tmp.*Read-only file system|working_directory_unavailable
severity: 3
category: autotools, build-system, hmdfs, ohos, platform, posix
match_keywords: shell_getcwd, working_directory_unavailable, readonly_tmp, hmbs_tmpdir, hmbs_platform_capabilities, hmbs_upstream_test_result
title: Autotools在HMDFS上getcwd/working_directory_unavailable与只读tmp+umask 077联合失败的PWD回退与TMPDIR重定向通用修复
root_cause: HMDFS上getcwd通过..向上遍历失败导致autoconf的ac_pwd=`pwd`检查直接失败且make/job-working-directory报working_directory_unavailable；OHOS的/tmp为erofs只读使configure/config.status/make的临时文件回退到/tmp报Read-only file system及Permission denied；autoconf生成的config.status以umask 077创建mktemp目录权限02700在HMDFS上进一步触发写失败，三者联合阻塞configure与make
verification_cmd: 真机preflight日志无getcwd: cannot access parent directories与error retrieving current directory且HMBS_PLATFORM_CAPABILITIES显示tmpdir为可写HMBS_TMPDIR，HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT显示status passed且make check非零证据
affected_scope: 采用Autotools且在HMDFS/erofs只读tmp环境下构建的C/C++库，特别是configure含ac_pwd=`pwd`工作目录检查与config.status使用umask 077+mktemp的项目，跨库复用
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: pwd-fallback-and-tmpdir-redirect
rec_description: 在conanfile中程序化修补configure的工作目录检查为PWD回退、统一重定向TMPDIR/TMP/TEMP到可写HMBS_TMPDIR并修正umask与config.status的mktemp模板，配合PWD导出与chdir规避shell getcwd调用
rec_command: conanfile.py新增_writable_tmpdir按HMBS_TMPDIR->TMPDIR->TMP->TEMP->~/tmp/darts-0.32回退并ensure目录，generate经AutotoolsToolchain.environment定义TMPDIR/TMP/TEMP且build写入os.environ，_patch_configure_workdir将umask 077改022并将ac_pwd=`pwd` && test -n改写为ac_pwd=`pwd` 2>/dev/null || ac_pwd="$PWD"，OHOS分支导出os.environ[PWD]=build_folder并os.chdir(build_folder)，_fix_config_status_mktemp重定向mktemp到$TMPDIR
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: manual-env-export-only
fallback_description: 若无法程序化改写configure则仅在build前导出TMPDIR与PWD并chdir到build目录，适用于configure未硬编码umask或可通过环境变量覆盖mktemp的简化场景
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: ac_pwd=`pwd` && test -n|umask 077|TMPDIR=/tmp|HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT.*"discovered":0.*"status":"passed"
forbid_1_reason: 禁止保留autoconf原始的getcwd强校验与umask 077及硬编码/tmp回退，也禁止零证据放行标记
forbid_1_consequence: 触发working_directory_unavailable或Read-only file system/Permission denied导致configure/config.status/make失败，或evidence incomplete被门禁退回
similar_to: [DRAFT-buildtorrent-tmpdir-fallback, DRAFT-boost-autotools-getcwd-other-domain, DRAFT-ali-posix-compat-other-domain, DRAFT-paperjam-network-other-domain]
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-darts-0.32-hmdfs-getcwd-tmpdir-pwd-fallback.md
last_updated: 2026-09-10
source_event: darts/0.32 真机预检HMDFS getcwd/working_directory_unavailable与只读tmp+umask 077联合失败并修复
authors: hmbs-executor
source_pr: 9286
